@startuml
title Managed replay-score source retention

start
:Select one exact cache file;
:Validate request key and complete gzip transport;
:Hash cache entry, response body,\nand request-qualified source identity;
:Persist pending score record under manifest lock;
:Publish exact decompressed body exclusively;
:Verify identity-bound unique path, regular file,\nbyte count, and body hash;
:Persist claim status;
:Score reviewer claims exact replay/fingerprint;
:Verify managed bytes and layered summaries;
:Record examined checkpoint;
:Record done only after all owners complete;
if (Exact score cleanup authorized?) then (yes)
  :Verify done state, reviews, safe path, and hash;
  :Persist retiring state before deletion;
  :Delete verified response if present;
  :Atomically add map-independent tombstone\nand remove score record;
else (no)
  :Retain managed response and score record;
endif
stop

note right
  No log reconciliation
  No map dependency
  No scoring analysis
  Missing file accepted only after retiring
end note

@enduml
